| When present at the start of a battle, may use 1 Force to cause one opponent's character of ability = 1 (your choice) to move away (for free), or that character is immediately lost. Immune to attrition &lt; 5. || {{Errata hl|When a battle was just initiated where present}}, may use 1 Force to {{Errata hl|choose}} one opponent’s character of ability = 1 {{Errata hl|present}} to move away (for free), or that character {{Errata hl|is lost}}. Immune to attrition &lt; 5.
